StickySessionConfig.StickySessionType.description_en:
Cookie handling method. When StickySessionConfig.StickySessionEnabled is set to **on**, this field is required. Options:

* insert (default): Insert Cookie;
   ALB records the backend server to which the client's first request is forwarded. ALB inserts a Cookie in the response, and subsequent client requests carrying this Cookie will be forwarded to the previously recorded backend server.
* server: Rewrite Cookie;
   When session persistence with Cookie rewriting is enabled, after the client's first request is forwarded to the backend server, if ALB finds your custom Cookie in the response, it rewrites the original Cookie. Subsequent client requests carrying the rewritten Cookie will be forwarded to the previously recorded backend server.

